{"id":"ha_ufig","lemma":"häufig","pos":"adv","rank":3197,"glosses":["frequently, often","in common, at once, together"],"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/3/38/De-at-h%C3%A4ufig.ogg/De-at-h%C3%A4ufig.ogg.mp3","examples":[{"text":"Hörst du häufig von ihm?","en":"Do you often hear from him?","words":[{"g":"to hear through the ear)","l":"hören"},{"g":"you"},null,{"g":"from / of"},{"g":"(to) him","l":"er"}]},{"text":"Es kommt häufig vor.","en":"It happens frequently.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/756904","words":[{"g":"it"},{"g":"to come","l":"kommen"},null,{"g":"in front of, ahead of"}]},{"text":"Sie kommt häufig in dieses Land.","en":"She's a frequent visitor to this country.","words":[{"g":"she / they / you"},{"g":"to come","l":"kommen"},null,{"g":"in"},{"g":"this one, this","l":"dieser"},{"g":"country"}]},{"text":"Vater sagte häufig, dass Zeit Geld ist.","en":"My father used to say that time is money.","words":[{"g":"father"},{"g":"to say (to pronounce","l":"sagen"},null,{"g":"that"},{"g":"time"},{"g":"money"},{"g":"is","l":"sein"}]},{"text":"Ich lese häufig Bücher.","en":"I often read books.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/392432","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to read","l":"lesen"},null,{"g":"book (collection of…","l":"Buch"}]}]}